SUMMARY:Gallery Grow is Celebrating Indie Retail Week!
DESCRIPTION:Gallery Grow is celebrating Indie Retail Week with special projects and discounts\, starting July 24th through August 1st. Stop in anytime during business hours to create your own jellyfish air plant terrarium for only $25.00!  \n\n\n\nWe will assist you in building and decorating your specialty terrarium with fun embellishments that highlight your jellyfish air plants\, along with guidance to help you Craft and care for your creation. While you explore the wide variety of houseplants\, pottery\, decor\, and art in our shop\, enjoy 15% off all plants the entire week! \n\n\n\n\n    Learn More
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/gallery-grow-is-celebrating-indie-retail-week/
LOCATION:Gallery Grow\, 320 North Queen Street\, Lancaster\, PA\, 17603\, United States
CATEGORIES:Education & Classes
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://fig.guide/content/uploads/sites/3/2026/07/Indie-Retail-Week.avif
END:VEVENT
