SUMMARY:Society of Curious Minds - Monthly Meeting
DESCRIPTION:Skip the small talk and dive into meaningful discourse with likeminded souls. Meeting monthly\, we explore life’s big questions over wine\, coffee\, and snacks. To keep conversations intimate\, spaces are limited and registration is required. You will have access to over 250 custom-crafted conversation prompts. Plus\, former attendees will have the exclusive opportunity to apply for our live podcast launching this August. \n            \n        \n                \n            \n                \n                \n    Register Now
