SUMMARY:LIPF Presents: An All-Shostakovich Concert
DESCRIPTION:Experience the magic of the music of Shostakovich live in concert in the thrilling finale of the 2026 Lancaster International Piano Festival!  Enjoy an evening of works for string octet\, piano trio and piano quintet in celebration of this exceptional composer’s 120th birthday! Featuring violinists Dana Allaband\, James Jin\, Fabiola Kim\, and Simon Maurer; violists Ning Mu and Agnes Maurer; cellists Julian Langford and Leo Singer; and pianists Ivo Kaltchev and Alessandra Feris. \n            \n        \n                \n            \n                \n                \n    Buy Tickets
