SUMMARY:Film Industry Night: Stories Behind the Screen
DESCRIPTION:Join Next Gen at Penn Cinema for networking\, a film industry panel\, audience Q&A\, and insights from professionals in filmmaking. Sponsored by the Red Rose Film Festival The film industry is built on creativity\, collaboration\, storytelling\, and innovation.  \n\n\n\nThe event will feature a moderated panel discussion led by Ryan Shank\, with industry professionals Derek Diener\, Catlin Baksa and Sarah McClure sharing their experiences working in and around the film industry. Panelists will discuss their career paths\, lessons learned\, industry trends\, challenges they have faced\, and what it takes to succeed in a rapidly evolving field. Whether you are interested in filmmaking\, media\, production\, storytelling\, marketing\, entrepreneurship\, or simply enjoy learning from professionals with unique career journeys\, this event will provide valuable insight and meaningful connections.  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n    Register Now
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/film-industry-night-stories-behind-the-screen/
LOCATION:Penn Cinema\, 541 Airport Rd\, Lititz\, PA\, 17543\, United States
CATEGORIES:Community
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://fig.guide/content/uploads/sites/3/2026/07/Next-Gen-Film-Industry-Night.avif
ORGANIZER;CN="Next Generation of Lancaster%2C PA":MAILTO:ej.pratt522@gmail.com
END:VEVENT
