SUMMARY:Build-a-Bog Garden Workshop
DESCRIPTION:Unwind at the end of your day and join Gallery Grow for an intimate happy hour workshop with expert instruction. As always\, BYOB. Create your own indoor bog garden featuring unique carnivorous plants and other moisture-loving plants in a beautiful glass container. Learn how to layer your garden\, arrange your plants\, and care for this fascinating miniature ecosystem. It’s a fun\, hands-on workshop perfect for plant lovers looking to grow something a little different. \n\n\n\n\n\n\n    Buy Tickets
