SUMMARY:Covenant Chocolate Chip Cookie Concert
DESCRIPTION:Ukulele Uprising – Free Community Concert\nJoin us for an evening of lively music\, laughter\, and community :\n•	Free cookies  \n•	Free parking\n•	Bring your ukulele! During the concert\, everyone is invited to join in for one fun audience participation song.\nWhether you’re a seasoned musician or simply love great live music\, you’ll enjoy this fun-filled evening. Bring your friends\, bring your family and celebrate the joy of music with us!\nWe look forward to seeing you there.\nArtists Display – Sandy Leonard and Joanne McIlvaney
