SUMMARY:Gin Garden Party at Demuth Museum of Art
DESCRIPTION:Join the Demuth Museum of Art for an evening of enjoying Charles Demuth’s favorite spirit in the Demuth garden! Cocktail samples will be generously provided by Lancaster Distilleries and Thistle Finch. Mocktail and non-alcoholic options are also available. Live music by Dane Fox will make for a fun evening.  \n\n\n\nDuring your visit\, check out Demuth Artist-in-Residence Abigail Dudley’s open studio at the Demuth Program Center (116 East King Street). \n\n\n\nAges 21+\, ID required. Admission is free. Two drink tickets per person will be provided on a first come\, first served basis. \n\n\n\nSupport provided by Art Bridges.
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/gin-garden-party-at-demuth-museum-of-art/
LOCATION:Oregon
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://fig.guide/content/uploads/sites/3/2026/07/Gemini_Generated_Image_6plwa36plwa36plw-e1783023981760.png
END:VEVENT
