SUMMARY:LUNA Dance Company: First Friday Preview Performance
DESCRIPTION:Experience an exciting preview of LUNA Dance Company’s upcoming Season 6 performance in this special First Friday event. As Lancaster’s professional contemporary dance company\, LUNA is committed to expanding access to exceptional dance experiences by bringing high-level performances\, nationally recognized artists\, and professional training opportunities to our local community.  \n\n\n\nThe evening will feature two original contemporary works showcasing the athleticism\, artistry\, and storytelling that define LUNA’s work. Audiences will also experience a unique live choreographic collaboration as Artistic Director Emmanuel Williams creates a brand-new piece in real time using prompts from the audience\, offering a rare opportunity to witness the creative process unfold live on stage. Following the performance\, stay for an interactive Q&A with Artistic Director Emmanuel Williams and LUNA’s dancers. Learn more about the creative process\, ask questions about the works you’ve seen\, and gain a behind-the-scenes perspective on what it takes to create and perform contemporary dance. Whether you’re a longtime dance enthusiast or experiencing contemporary dance for the first time\, this interactive evening offers a unique opportunity to engage with the artists while previewing LUNA’s full Season 6 performance on September 26. Join us for an evening of creativity\, collaboration\, and conversation as LUNA continues cultivating professional contemporary dance in Lancaster. \n\n\n\n\n    Learn More
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/luna-dance-company-first-friday-preview-performance/
LOCATION:Ware Center for the Arts\, 42 N. Prince St.\, Lancaster\, PA\, 17603\, United States
CATEGORIES:Arts & Entertainment
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://fig.guide/content/uploads/sites/3/2026/07/2026.08.07-LUNA-Dance.avif
ORGANIZER;CN="Millersville University Office of Visual & Performing Arts":MAILTO:cori.jackson@millersville.edu
END:VEVENT
